use anyhow :: { Context , Result } ; use std :: path :: { Path , PathBuf } ; use std :: fs ; use std :: process :: Command ; use std :: collections :: HashSet ; use super :: * ; use tempfile :: tempdir ; # [doc = " Generate .cargo/config.toml patches"] fn generate_patches (workspace_path : & Path) -> Result < () > { println ! ("  🩹 Generating patches...") ; let output = Command :: new ("cargo") . args (["run" , "--release" , "--" , "patch"]) . current_dir (workspace_path) . output () ; match output { Ok (out) if out . status . success () => { println ! ("  ✅ Patches generated") ; } _ => { println ! ("  ⚠️  Patch generation not available, skipping") ; } } Ok (()) }